/* ══ typed scenes: new situations whose sums are worked here ══════════════════
   Each takes the generator's kit — { r, s (one coin), big, w, w2, int, pick, m } — and
   returns { q, value, why, hint }. Every amount goes through m(), so it is priced in the
   child's currency (and, in My Feed, at render); the hint is a method, never a number. */
